{"hw":"πρυτάνειος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πρυτάνειος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πρυτάν-ειος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">α</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">of</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">belonging to the prytanes</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aristid.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">50(26).88</span> </span>; cf. <span class=\"gk\">πρυτανεία</span> (B).</div></div>"}